  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほのおエネルギーとありあまる　！\u0003\u0007生命力せいめいりょく生命力が　まじりずじょうに　タマゴがたの　ひだまが　あらわれた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "불꽃 에너지와 남아도는 생명력이 섞여서 머리 위에 알 모양의 불덩이가 생겨났다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "火之能量與過剩的生命力相互結合，使得牠頭上出現了蛋狀的火球。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La boule de feu en forme d’œuf qui surmonte sa tête résulte de la fusion entre son énergie de type Feu et son trop-plein de vitalité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Feuer-Energie und sein Überschuss an Lebenskraft brachten gemeinsam den eiförmigen Feuerball auf seinem Kopf hervor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La mezcla de energía ígnea con el exceso de su propia fuerza vital ha tomado la forma de una bola de fuego de aspecto oval sobre su cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’energia Fuoco e la forza vitale in eccesso si sono combinate formando la palla di fuoco ovoidale sulla sua testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The combination of Crocalor’s fire energy and overflowing vitality has caused an egg-shaped fireball to appear on the Pokémon’s head.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "炎エネルギーと有り余る　！\u0003\u0007生命力せいめいりょく生命力が　交じり頭上に　タマゴ型の　火玉が　現れた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由于火之能量与过剩的生命力相互结合，使它头上出现了蛋状的火球。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La mezcla de energía ígnea con el exceso de su propia fuerza vital ha tomado la forma de una bola de fuego de aspecto oval sobre su cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せいたいと　ほのおぶくろの　べんはみっせつな　かんけい。　だみごえをあげながら　ほのおを　はきちらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "성대와 불꽃 주머니는 밀접하게 관계되어 있다. 탁한 소리를 내며 불꽃을 토해 낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "聲帶和火囊的閥緊鄰在一起。會一邊發出嘶啞的聲音，一邊噴灑火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses cordes vocales et la valve de sa poche à flammes sont étroitement liées, ce qui lui permet de pousser des cris gutturaux en crachant du feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Das Ventil für seinen Flammensack ist eng mit den Stimmbändern verbunden. Wenn es Feuer spuckt, stößt es raue Laute aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus cuerdas vocales y la válvula de su saca de fuego están estrechamente relacionadas. Emite sonidos guturales al expeler llamas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue corde vocali sono strettamente collegate alla valvola della sacca ignea. Mentre sputa fiammate tutt’intorno, emette versi rauchi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The valve in Crocalor’s flame sac is closely connected to its vocal cords. This Pokémon utters a guttural cry as it spews flames every which way.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
